      "message": "I was not aware the need of multiple zephyr boards when I made the CL:2987912. The CL:2987912 carries over the same EC-OS baseboard/board concept, i.e.\n * EC-OS baseboard: herobrine -\u003e Zephyr board: herobrine\n * EC-OS board: herobrine_npcx7 -\u003e Zephyr project: herobrine_npcx7\n\nUntil I made the NPCX9 support, CL:2993220. The 1:1 mapping baseboard concept is not longer valid. I have to create a different Zephyr board, to support a different chip architecture. So this CL is needed.\n\nSquashing two CLs also work. But seems to add too much change to the CL:2987912, hardware difference + concept change.",
